#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/components.rst:14
msgid "EcosRecordsSync camel component"
msgstr "EcosRecordsSync Camel Component"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/components.rst:16
msgid ""
"**EcosRecordsSyncComponent** — компонент camel, созданный для "
"перебора/обновления записей через RecordsAPI. Ключ для использования "
"компонента в camel-контексте: *ecos-records-sync*"
msgstr ""
"**EcosRecordsSyncComponent** - a Camel component created for "
"iterating/updating records via RecordsAPI. The key for using the "
"component in a Camel context: *ecos-records-sync*"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/components.rst:18
msgid ""
"Компонент включает в себя как потребителя *EcosRecordsSyncConsumer*, так "
"и производителя *EcosRecordsSyncProducer* по терминологии camel."
msgstr ""
"The component includes both a consumer (*EcosRecordsSyncConsumer*) and a "
"producer (*EcosRecordsSyncProducer*) in Camel terminology"

#: ../../integration/Camel_DSL/components.rst:20
msgid ""
"Ниже будут примеры регистрации компонента в yaml формате, например, при "
"регистрации через Camel DSL."
msgstr ""
"Below are examples of registering the component in YAML format, for "
"instance, when registering via Camel DSL."

